# Claimless - environment variables (NO SECRETS - this file is committed)
#
# This file is PUBLIC. It documents which variables exist. It must never
# contain a real value for any secret.
#
#   1. Copy this file to .env        (cp .env.example .env)
#   2. Put real values in .env only  (.env is git-ignored)
#   3. Never paste a key into this file
#
# If a secret ever lands here it is one 'git add -A' away from a public repo.
# See docs/SECRETS.md.

# Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬ Chain: Monad testnet (10143) Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬
MONAD_RPC_URL=https://testnet-rpc.monad.xyz
MONAD_CHAIN_ID=10143
# Deployer key. Leave empty until you are ready to deploy.
MONAD_PRIVATE_KEY=
# Optional mainnet RPC (only for reading mainnet registries)
MONAD_MAINNET_RPC_URL=https://rpc.monad.xyz

