# Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬ Envio (indexer) Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬
# Free API token from https://envio.dev/app/api-tokens (needed for HyperSync).
# Token-free fallback: run the indexer with CONFIG_FILE=config.rpc.yaml, which
# reads MONAD_RPC_URL instead of HyperSync. See indexer/README.md.
ENVIO_API_TOKEN=
# Selects the indexer config file. "config.yaml" = HyperSync (needs the token),
# "config.rpc.yaml" = token-free RPC via MONAD_RPC_URL.
CONFIG_FILE=config.yaml
# Host port for the indexer's own Postgres. 5433, NOT 5432: 5432 is already
# occupied on this machine by agentic-scraper-postgres + a local Postgres.
ENVIO_PG_PORT=5433
# Host port for Hasura GraphQL (8080 may be taken). Console: :8081/console
HASURA_EXTERNAL_PORT=8081

